      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1c0qjtm'
    '|b||A homeowner restores the old façade of her house on a historic street. Everyone who walks past enjoys it; nobody pays her. Left alone, the market gives…':
